[l_english.autonomy_pihc_dominion]
Dominion

[l_english.autonomy_pihc_dominion_desc]
It has a relatively high degree of independence in law, and the master’s rule has less interference with the territory.

[l_simp_chinese.autonomy_pihc_dominion]
自治领

[l_simp_chinese.autonomy_pihc_dominion_desc]
法理上具有较高独立性，宗主的统治对于领地干预较少。
